title: "Sex differences in the hepatic immune landscape of MASLD: analysis code"
abstract: >-
  Analysis code and processed data for a public-data transcriptomic meta-analysis
  of sex differences in the hepatic immune compartment of MASLD/MASH, with a
  disease-free control and single-cell validation.
